  "notable_quotes": [
    "Cd(1,2,4-triazole)2(H2PO4)2 (Cd-Tz) shows near-zero thermal expansion from 25 K to 400 K, an unusual broad temperature window for a 2D coordination polymer.",
    "Cd-Tz nZTE arises from opposing anisotropic responses: NTE along b (αb ≈ -47 MK−1) and PTE in the ac plane (αa, αc ≈ 22 MK−1).",
    "Cd-Tz volumetric nZTE is frustrated rather than monotonic, with slight hysteresis beyond 45 K during cooling/heating and nearly constant Vcell above 200 K."
  ],
